#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:1
msgid "操作指南：在脚本和 CI 中消费命令输出"
msgstr "How-to: Consume command output in scripts and CI"

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:3
msgid "`validate` 和 `inspect` 是脚本友好的：stdout 只输出一个 JSON envelope，进度和诊断走 stderr。不要解析帮助文本，也不要把错误信封当成功。"
msgstr "`validate` and `inspect` are script-friendly: stdout carries exactly one JSON envelope while progress and diagnostics go to stderr. Do not parse help text, and never treat an error envelope as success."

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:5
msgid "成功信封"
msgstr "Success envelope"

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:23
msgid "字段名以实际输出为准；先读 `ok`，不要靠文本猜测。"
msgstr "Field names follow the actual output; read `ok` first and never guess from text."

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:25
msgid "失败信封"
msgstr "Error envelope"

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:40
msgid "`type`、`subtype`、`message`、`hint` 都是结构化字段；`hint` 是可执行的下一步。修复源头后重试，不要绕过校验。"
msgstr "`type`, `subtype`, `message`, and `hint` are structured fields; `hint` is an actionable next step. Fix the source and retry; do not bypass validation."

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:42
msgid "在 CI 里用"
msgstr "Using it in CI"

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:49
msgid "也可以用 `--pretty` 让终端阅读更舒服，但机器解析请用默认的紧凑 JSON。各命令的参数以 `--help` 为准。"
msgstr "You may use `--pretty` for comfortable terminal reading, but machine parsing should use the default compact JSON. Each command's parameters follow its `--help`."

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:51
msgid "例外"
msgstr "Exceptions"

#: ../../how-to/use-json-output.md:53
msgid "`--help` 和 `--version` 输出纯文本，不受 JSON 信封约束；交互式 TUI 的画面写 stderr，stdout 保持未使用。"
msgstr "`--help` and `--version` output plain text and are exempt from the JSON envelope; the interactive TUI renders to stderr and leaves stdout unused."
